      ],
      "text": "Reach is fragile and softening: only 18.2 of every 100 who see the announce go on to play, against a usual 29.5, and the share of views from search and suggested sits at 11.8 against 13.9 — both readings carried from an older finished episode.",
      "recommendation": "Rewrite this week's announce posts around one specific hook and a timestamp instead of a generic go-live note, and test a search-friendly title and new thumbnail on the next upload to see if discovery recovers."
    },
